Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 19:02:45 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 34/35] metal: 512 threads/group, empty-tile early return,
 parallel corrections

gpu_exec 3.90->3.12s, 4096/2amin inversion 10.1->9.3s. Gates: probe
2.95e-07, 50k 1.53e-08, 1024 dirty T2 4.94e-06.

Diagnostics added: per-batch DMA byte counters and a tile-occupancy
report (only ~2% of 15376 tiles carry work), which showed transfer and
disk are not the bottleneck.

